    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95957" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλαγχν-ίζω</span></b> ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλαγχνεύω</span>, <i><span class="en">
			LXX
			<u>2 Ma.</u>
			6.8
		</span></i>:—
			Pass.
		, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Abh.Berl.Akad.</u>
			1928(6).12
		</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			 (with aor.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίσθην</span>), <i>feel pity,
			compassion</i>, or <i>mercy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Pr.</u>
				17.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
					6.34
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.2
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					9.36
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐσπλαγχνίσθη</span>
			<i>had</i> no <i>mercy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				296.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>.</div>
